# Radiance on Destroy (DestroyEffect.java:54): Leave No Trace targets the
# human's white Glorious Anthem; the ai's white Crusade is destroyed with it
# although never targeted. The green Gaea's Anthem shares no color and stays.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
queue targets 4
queue paygeneric W
queue action human cast 1
passpriority
